==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[leika]]'' meaning "to [[play]]" + the reflexive pronoun ''[[sér]]'', which is the {{dative}} form of ''[[sig]]'' meaning "[[oneself]]".

===Verb===
'''leika sér'''

# to [[play]]
#: ''Börnin eru að '''leika sér'''.''
#:: The children are '''playing'''.
#: ''Ég '''leik mér''' að bolta.''
#:: I '''play''' with a ball.

